==German==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|vrosch}}, from {{inh|de|goh|frosk||frog}}, from {{inh|de|gmw-pro|*frosk||frog}}, from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*fruskaz||frog}}, from {{der|de|ine-pro|*prew-||jump, hop}}.

Cognate with {{cog|gml|vorsch||frog}}, {{cog|nl|vors}}, {{cog|fy|froask}}, {{cog|is|froskur}}, dialectal {{cog|en|frosh||frog}}.

